              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nejoki Yesu ninche, “Keitu ae kata isomama too lkigerot, ‘Ore ilo soit otanyaita lashetak otaa osoit kitok lo lmairroto. Ore ilo rorei naa Olaitoriani eing'uaa, naa ole nking'asia too nkonyek ang.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.21.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.21.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 21:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enkaraki e ina pee ajoki intae, keoruni intae enkitoria e Nkai aaisho olorere oiki lng'anayio, [",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.21.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.21.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 21:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naa ore olosulakino ilo soit, negiligil. Ore olosulakino ilo soit ninye neidong aitaa emposio.]”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.21.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.21.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
